    "input": "search_document: I understand you are in an urgent situation and need immediate access to your account to check your order and make a payment. I will address your concerns regarding the login issue, data breach policies, and account deletion based strictly on the provided handbook excerpts.\n\n**1. Regarding your inability to log in:**\nThe handbook does not provide specific troubleshooting steps for general login failures (such as \"I tried everything and it\u2019s just not working\"). However, it does specify conditions that cause account locks or restrictions:\n*   If you have exceeded **5 failed login attempts per hour**, your account is locked for **30 minutes** [accounts.2].\n*   If you have lost access to your **Two-Factor Authentication (2FA)** device, your account access is restricted to **read-only mode** (you can view orders but cannot place new ones or change billing details) until support verifies your identity, which takes up to **48 hours** [accounts.3].\n*   If your email was not verified within **24 hours** of registration, your account is suspended [accounts.1].\n\nSince you are unable to pay or check status, and the handbook does not offer a self-service \"fast fix\" for these specific lockouts beyond waiting out the 30-minute lock or the 48-hour 2FA verification, I cannot provide a solution to restore full access immediately using only the provided text.\n\n**2. Regarding data breach notifications:**\nYou are correct. If a security breach occurs that affects **more than 500 customers**, Northwind Outdoor will notify you via email within **72 hours** [privacy.5].\n\n**3. Regarding account deletion:**\nYou are correct that deletion requests are processed within **10 business days** [privacy.4]. However, please note that even after deletion, financial transaction records are retained for **7 years** to comply with tax regulations [accounts.4]. Additionally, if you do not confirm the deletion request within **10 days** of the initial request, the request is voided [accounts.4].\n\n**Conclusion and Escalation:**\nThe handbook excerpts do not contain a procedure to bypass the 30-minute lock, the 48-hour 2FA verification, or the 10-business-day deletion processing time. Because your issue is urgent and the provided text does not offer a mechanism to resolve the login block immediately, I must escalate this ticket to a human agent who may have access to additional support tools or manual override procedures not listed in these excerpts.\n\n**I am escalating your ticket to a human agent for immediate assistance with your login access.**",
